 {r}←UpdateCommandTable prjCfg;path;table;rows;src;start;end;Quote
⍝ Re-generates the table inside `UC.List` from the metadata carried by the user command
⍝ functions themselves; see `GetCommandTable`.\\
⍝ The function is fixed in the workspace, so Link writes it back to `UC/List.aplf`. Run this
⍝ before `InjectListOfObjectsIntoUserCommandScript`, which takes it from there.
 r←⍬
 path←prjCfg.HOME,'/APLSource/APLGit2/UC'
 table←GetCommandTable path
 Quote←{'''',(⍵/⍨1+''''=⍵),''''}
 rows←{'     table⍪←',(Quote 1⊃⍵),' ',(Quote 2⊃⍵),' ',(⍕3⊃⍵),' ',Quote 4⊃⍵}¨↓table
 src←##.APLGit2.UC.⎕NR'List'
 start←⍸∨/¨'⍝ >>>>> StartTableInject'∘⍷¨src
 end←⍸∨/¨'⍝ >>>>> EndTableInject'∘⍷¨src
 'The markers were not found in UC.List'Assert 1 1≡(≢start)(≢end)
 src←(start↑src),rows,(end-1)↓src
 'Could not fix UC.List'Assert'List'≡##.APLGit2.UC.⎕FX src
⍝Done
